835: ## 6. View Controller 4: Content Details & Episode Selector Controller (`app/js/views/details.js`)
836: 
837: ### 6.1 Responsibilities
838: 1. Fetches full item details via `TmdbClient.getDetails(mediaType, id)` with `append_to_response=credits,recommendations,similar`.
839: 2. Binds high-resolution backdrop image (`w1280` or `original`), title, star rating, release year, runtime, certification badge, genres, and synopsis.
840: 3. Renders action button group:
841:    - "Play Stream" (`#details-play-btn`, `data-nav="true"`, `data-nav-group="details-actions"`, `data-nav-default="true"`).
842:    - "Trailer" button.
843:    - "Add to List" button (toggles local watchlist state).
844: 4. Populates Top Cast horizontal carousel with 80px circular avatars.
845: 5. TV Show Season & Episode Selector:
846:    - Evaluates `mediaType === 'tv'`.
847:    - Generates Season Tabs (`Season 1`, `Season 2`, ...).
848:    - Fetches season episodes via `TmdbClient.getTvSeason(tvId, seasonNumber)`.
849:    - Renders 16:9 episode still cards with `E{N}` badge, runtime, title, overview, and Play dispatch payload `{ tmdbId, type: 'tv', season, episode }`.
850: 6. For Movies (`mediaType === 'movie'`): Hides the season/episode shelf and renders "More Like This" recommendations.
